---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';

const factors = [
  ['Scope', 'Page count, content readiness, and whether the brief is tightly defined or still evolving.'],
  ['Platform', 'A simple static site is leaner than a CMS, shop, booking flow, or custom integration.'],
  ['Content', 'Copy, photography, product data, and migration work all affect the time involved.'],
  ['Ambition', 'A launch-ready brochure site and a bespoke lead-generation platform are different projects.'],
];
---

<MainLayout
  title="How Much Does a Website Cost in Hampshire? | Meon Valley Web"
  description="Most professional small-business websites start around £2,500. Focused five-page static sites with content ready can start around £250–£500."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Blog', href: '/blog' }, { name: 'Website costs in Hampshire' }]}
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#111315] py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 78% 12%, #c51d65 0, transparent 25%), linear-gradient(140deg, transparent 0 57%, #272b2e 57% 58%, transparent 58%);"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary-300">Hampshire website pricing</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.04] text-white">A website should fit <span class="text-primary-400">the job it needs to do.</span></h1>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed text-gray-300">There is no useful one-size-fits-all price. A focused, content-ready five-page static site can start around £250–£500. Most professional small-business websites start around £2,500, with the final quote shaped by scope and ambition.</p>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center"><a href="/contact" class="bg-primary-500 text-white px-7 py-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-400 transition font-semibold text-lg">Discuss your project</a><a href="#what-changes-the-price" class="border border-white/30 text-white px-7 py-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition font-semibold text-lg">What affects the price?</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-8 sm:p-10"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-600">Focused static site</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-950">From £250–£500</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">A straightforward five-page site for a clear offer, when copy, images, and structure are ready to go. This is a fixed-scope, fast-turnaround option, not a watered-down version of a larger build.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700"><li>• Home, about, services, contact, and one supporting page</li><li>• Responsive static build and contact form</li><li>• Essential metadata and launch checks</li></ul></article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-950 p-8 sm:p-10 text-white"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-300">Most business projects</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">From around £2,500</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-300">The right fit for most established small businesses: more discovery, a tailored content structure, stronger conversion journeys, and the flexibility to grow after launch.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-200"><li>• Bespoke design and content-led page structure</li><li>• CMS, integrations, or more involved functionality where needed</li><li>• Accessibility, performance, and SEO foundations</li></ul></article>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-gray-500">E-commerce, memberships, booking systems, migrations, and bespoke functionality are quoted against the actual requirements.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="what-changes-the-price" class="bg-gray-50 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-600">The variables</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-950">What changes the price?</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600">A clear brief does more for your budget than a generic price list. These are the questions we use to recommend the right route.</p></div>
      <div class="mt-10 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-200">{factors.map(([title, description], index) => <article class="bg-white p-7 sm:p-8"><span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-primary-600">0{index + 1}</span><h3 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-950">{title}</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">{description}</p></article>)}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-950">Tell us what you need, not what you think you should spend.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600">We will be clear if a focused static site is enough, and equally clear when a larger brief needs more time. You will get a fixed scope and a transparent quote before work starts.</p><a href="/contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex bg-primary-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-600 transition font-semibold text-lg">Get a clear quote</a></div></section>
</MainLayout>
